pbs-zabbix (0.1.2) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Ship an importable Zabbix 7.4 template (zabbix/template_pbs_backup.yaml)
    bundling the discovery rule, item and trigger prototypes, so alerting
    no longer depends on manually recreating them from the README
  * Trigger prototype now also fires on nodata() for pbs.backup.age[*], not
    just a stale last() value, so a backup that never even ran (PBS never
    powered on, network down, agent unreachable) is caught instead of
    silently freezing the item at its last known value
  * README: document importing the template and recommend active checks
    (ServerActive) on PBS hosts that are only powered on intermittently

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Mon, 14 Sep 2026 17:26:42 +0200

pbs-zabbix (0.1.1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * discovery: only report VMs/CTs with backup activity in the last 45
    days, so stale leftovers (a removed VM, or setup/test data from a
    since-deleted datastore or user) do not linger as permanently-stale
    Zabbix items/triggers

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Sat, 12 Sep 2026 12:17:46 +0200

pbs-zabbix (0.1.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * pbs-zabbix-backup-check: Zabbix LLD discovery, age[] and laststatus[]
    UserParameters driven by Proxmox Backup Server task logs
  * zabbix/pbs-backup.conf UserParameter definitions for zabbix-agent2

